{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/privacy-policy/layout,_N_T_/privacy-policy/page,_N_T_/privacy-policy"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/privacy-policy/__PAGE__","/privacy-policy","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/15g6f3-b9zkmm.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0yu3k-pmkudgf.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0dgq26a5_oy.a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0m_p1bxtorv5i.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0vn2e3cj4vv3r.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-13.r4nhvyn5bp.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0ok6ybmrp8tr2.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0ka051yepewro.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" as=\"style\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://plausible.io/js/script.js\" as=\"script\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://analytics.ahrefs.com/analytics.js\" as=\"script\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"/><title>Privacy Policy | Meigen AI</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Privacy Policy for Meigen AI. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal data.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"meigen ai,AI quote generator,quote card maker,social media quote design,daily quote generator,inspirational quote AI\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://meigenai.org\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Meigen AI — AI Quote Studio\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Generate original quotes and turn them into brand-ready visual cards with Meigen AI. 20+ templates, batch export, multi-platform sizes. Free to try.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://meigenai.org\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Meigen AI\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://meigenai.org/og-image.jpg\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Meigen AI — Turn Ideas into Shareable Quotes in 30 Seconds\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Meigen AI — AI Quote Studio\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Generate original quotes and turn them into brand-ready visual cards with Meigen AI. 20+ templates, batch export, multi-platform sizes. Free to try.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://meigenai.org/og-image.jpg\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0x3dzn~oxb6tn.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.svg\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#0c0c0e] text-[#f5f0e8]\"><div class=\"max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-24\"><a class=\"inline-block mb-12 text-sm text-[#a09b94] hover:text-[#d4a853] transition-colors\" href=\"/\">← Back to Home</a><h1 class=\"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold mb-8\">Privacy Policy</h1><p class=\"text-[#a09b94] mb-12\">Last updated: May 12, 2026</p><div class=\"space-y-10 text-[#a09b94] leading-relaxed\"><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">1. Introduction</h2><p>Meigen AI (&quot;we&quot;, &quot;us&quot;, or &quot;our&quot;) respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website and use our services.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">2. Information We Collect</h2><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2\"><li><strong class=\"text-[#f5f0e8]\">Account data:</strong> email address, password hash, and optional profile information.</li><li><strong class=\"text-[#f5f0e8]\">Usage data:</strong> quotes generated, templates selected, export counts, and feature interactions.</li><li><strong class=\"text-[#f5f0e8]\">Payment data:</strong> <!-- -->processed securely by Stripe. We do not store full credit card numbers.</li><li><strong class=\"text-[#f5f0e8]\">Brand assets:</strong> <!-- -->uploaded logos, color preferences, and font selections for template rendering.</li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">3. How We Use Your Information</h2><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2\"><li>To provide and maintain our services</li><li>To process payments and manage subscriptions</li><li>To improve our AI models and template recommendations</li><li>To communicate product updates and billing information</li><li>To comply with legal obligations</li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">4. Data Sharing</h2><p>We do not sell your personal data. We share data only with: trusted service providers (Stripe for payments, Cloudflare for hosting), and when required by law or to protect our rights.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">5. Your Rights (GDPR / CCPA)</h2><ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2\"><li>Access, correct, or delete your personal data</li><li>Export your data in a portable format</li><li>Object to certain processing activities</li><li>Withdraw consent at any time</li></ul><p class=\"mt-4\">To exercise these rights, contact us at<!-- --> <a href=\"mailto:support@meigenai.org\" class=\"text-[#d4a853] hover:underline\">support@meigenai.org</a>.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">6. Data Retention</h2><p>We retain your data for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide services. Upon account deletion, we remove personal data within 30 days, except where retention is required by law.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">7. Cookies</h2><p>We use essential cookies for authentication and functional cookies for preferences. We use analytics cookies only with your consent. See our<!-- --> <a class=\"text-[#d4a853] hover:underline\" href=\"/cookie-policy\">Cookie Policy</a> <!-- -->for details.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-[#f5f0e8] mb-4\">8. Contact Us</h2><p>For privacy-related questions, email<!-- --> <a href=\"mailto:support@meigenai.org\" class=\"text-[#d4a853] hover:underline\">support@meigenai.org</a>.</p></section></div></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0yu3k-pmkudgf.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ok6ybmrp8tr2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_